Review the use of `console.log` statements.  Are they necessary for debugging, or should they be removed before merging?  If they are for debugging, consider replacing them with more robust logging mechanisms.
{% endif %}

{% if user.role == "reviewer" %}
Your primary responsibility is to ensure the code meets quality standards and the functionality is correct.  Focus on identifying potential issues and suggesting improvements.
{% elif user.role == "author" %}
Consider the feedback provided and address any concerns raised.  Be prepared to justify your design decisions and discuss alternative approaches.
{% endif %}

